WEBVTT

00:09.009 --> 00:10.802
Are we sure the patient is okay?

00:10.885 --> 00:12.095
BP is dropping again.

00:12.178 --> 00:13.930
Hang on. Let me check.

01:01.352 --> 01:02.771
You should eat these.

01:04.856 --> 01:06.858
You have to eat well today.

01:06.941 --> 01:08.193
Thank you.

01:08.276 --> 01:09.194
You're welcome.

01:32.675 --> 01:35.929
Excuse me. The girl that was here.
Do you know where she went?

01:36.012 --> 01:37.430
She left a while ago.

01:37.514 --> 01:38.640
When was that?

01:39.516 --> 01:40.642
About ten minutes ago.

01:42.560 --> 01:43.436
Thank you.

02:48.251 --> 02:49.210
Excuse me.

02:50.753 --> 02:53.423
Are you Hong Woo-jin's guardian?

02:53.965 --> 02:55.258
Well, yes.

02:56.092 --> 02:57.719
The operation went well.

02:58.761 --> 03:02.140
We'll have to monitor his progress,
but the operation was a success.

03:12.025 --> 03:12.901
Thank you.

03:15.111 --> 03:16.696
Thank you so much.

03:19.991 --> 03:21.159
Hang in there.

03:21.659 --> 03:23.161
Okay.

03:58.905 --> 04:02.283
BLOODHOUNDS

04:17.757 --> 04:20.718
MARINE SPIRIT!
KIM MYEONG-GIL

05:02.010 --> 05:02.844
Hey.

05:03.886 --> 05:05.555
It freaks me out every time.

05:07.098 --> 05:07.932
Let's go.

05:18.151 --> 05:18.985
Let's go.

05:25.283 --> 05:26.117
Let's run.

06:28.888 --> 06:30.014
Eighty-six!

06:31.015 --> 06:31.891
Eighty-eight!

06:31.974 --> 06:33.393
Eighty-nine!

06:34.143 --> 06:34.977
- Ninety!
- Ten more!

06:36.187 --> 06:37.021
One!

06:37.814 --> 06:38.856
Two!

06:38.940 --> 06:39.774
Three!

06:42.944 --> 06:43.945
Twelve.

06:44.612 --> 06:45.446
Thirteen.

06:47.698 --> 06:48.533
Fourteen.

06:48.616 --> 06:50.118
Good morning, sir.

06:51.411 --> 06:52.578
Good morning, sir.

07:06.426 --> 07:07.301
Let's keep going.

07:11.806 --> 07:12.765
Fifteen.

07:14.100 --> 07:14.934
Sixteen.

07:15.017 --> 07:16.519
One, two, three, four!

07:17.603 --> 07:19.772
One, two, three, four, five!

07:19.856 --> 07:21.107
One, two, three, four!

07:22.066 --> 07:23.359
One, two, three, four!

07:24.444 --> 07:25.862
One, two, three, four!

07:26.404 --> 07:27.947
One, two, three, four!

07:28.573 --> 07:30.408
One, two, three, four!

07:49.051 --> 07:50.803
Man, you actually did it!

07:58.728 --> 08:00.521
Woo-jin, get up.

08:02.857 --> 08:05.818
To break their balance,
we should do this to topple them--

08:05.902 --> 08:07.028
Guys.

08:07.820 --> 08:08.946
We need to talk.

08:12.492 --> 08:14.035
I said no.

08:14.785 --> 08:17.288
If you go back,
you'll die a pointless death.

08:18.456 --> 08:21.751
I know why
you're worried about us, Mr. Oh.

08:21.834 --> 08:23.169
Then why won't you listen?

08:23.920 --> 08:24.921
Are you rebelling?

08:25.505 --> 08:26.589
Mr. Oh.

08:27.381 --> 08:29.425
Today, I'll tell you what I think.

08:32.053 --> 08:35.097
I believe we can fight
Kim Myeong-gil and win.

08:40.603 --> 08:43.064
Yang-jung and Du-yeong are dead.

08:43.648 --> 08:44.774
How can you guys win?

08:45.358 --> 08:47.944
By following Mr. Choi's instructions.

08:50.112 --> 08:53.866
Many have lost their families
and had precious things taken away by Kim.

08:54.450 --> 08:57.245
Mr. Choi said if we gathered them
and combined our strengths,

08:57.328 --> 08:59.288
we would win no matter what.

09:00.456 --> 09:03.000
Everyone is hiding
because they can't win fighting alone.

09:03.084 --> 09:07.713
But if people like me and Woo-jin show up,
I'm sure they'll help us.

09:08.798 --> 09:11.926
What if Kim Myeong-gil
catches you beforehand?

09:12.009 --> 09:13.678
We're capable of fighting.

09:13.761 --> 09:16.597
Woo-jin has fully healed,
and I've gone up two weight classes.

09:16.681 --> 09:18.099
My punches are stronger now.

09:18.182 --> 09:20.893
We're more than ready
to take down his goons.

09:20.977 --> 09:23.479
If we take everyone's advice,

09:23.563 --> 09:25.690
I believe we can take Kim Myeong-gil down.

09:27.775 --> 09:30.611
I won't allow it,

09:31.696 --> 09:32.738
and that's that.

10:12.945 --> 10:16.907
Mr. Oh, I'll be in Rome
by the time you read this letter.

10:18.117 --> 10:21.662
I rented out a small room
with the money Grandpa gave me.

10:22.997 --> 10:25.791
I promised Grandpa
that we'd go to Rome together

10:25.875 --> 10:27.585
after getting Kim Myeong-gil,

10:28.169 --> 10:29.920
but I ruined everything.

10:31.505 --> 10:33.591
I won't ask you to understand my actions.

10:34.925 --> 10:39.055
But if I stay here, I'll think of Grandpa.
And I don't think I can handle that.

10:40.222 --> 10:42.350
Wherever I go, I'm reminded of Grandpa,

10:43.601 --> 10:45.394
and I can't stop crying.

10:46.145 --> 10:47.605
It's driving me insane.

10:48.522 --> 10:51.233
It'll get better
if I go somewhere far away.

10:52.610 --> 10:53.527
I love you,

10:54.278 --> 10:55.196
and I'm sorry.

11:08.584 --> 11:10.127
Man, this hurts so much.

11:10.920 --> 11:12.338
What you're feeling isn't pain.

11:13.005 --> 11:14.965
It's your weaknesses leaving your body.

11:15.049 --> 11:16.425
What does that mean?

11:17.551 --> 11:19.595
It means you're stronger today
than yesterday.

11:24.225 --> 11:25.059
Guys.

11:26.268 --> 11:27.228
Follow me.

11:30.856 --> 11:31.691
Yes, sir.

11:49.917 --> 11:53.129
This is the last
of Mr. Choi's emergency fund.

11:53.963 --> 11:54.797
Take it and go.

11:55.881 --> 11:59.552
I tried to hold you back
because of my worries. I'm sorry.

12:00.344 --> 12:02.555
I'll prepare a room
and car for you in Seoul.

12:03.431 --> 12:04.432
Stay safe.

12:06.434 --> 12:08.686
Thank you, Mr. Oh.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.733
We'll win, no matter what.

12:47.016 --> 12:52.563
STONE VILLAGE

12:55.733 --> 12:56.567
Unit 809.

13:00.654 --> 13:01.655
Woo-jin.

13:11.707 --> 13:12.541
Yes?

13:16.879 --> 13:17.838
Yes, hello.

13:17.922 --> 13:21.050
We were sent by Mr. Oh In-muk.

13:29.767 --> 13:30.601
Come in.

13:30.684 --> 13:31.602
Let's go.

13:40.778 --> 13:45.449
Now, if I come back and notice
any signs of tampering with the tape,

13:45.533 --> 13:47.034
I'll report you to the police.

13:47.952 --> 13:48.786
Why is that?

13:49.620 --> 13:50.871
My underwear is in there.

13:51.997 --> 13:54.333
Right, that will never happen.

13:56.210 --> 13:58.003
One bed here and one on top.

13:58.087 --> 13:59.296
Who wants the top?

13:59.797 --> 14:01.215
- It doesn't matter.
- Yes.

14:02.216 --> 14:03.342
Then you take the top.

14:03.425 --> 14:04.343
All right.

14:04.426 --> 14:08.931
I'm sorry, but may I ask
the reason for that decision?

14:10.349 --> 14:11.392
I felt like it.

14:12.643 --> 14:13.477
I see.

14:16.814 --> 14:19.984
Here are the keys to the door
and the car Grandpa told me to rent.

14:22.319 --> 14:25.155
Also, here's my number.
But if possible, don't call.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.073
I'm busy.

14:26.740 --> 14:28.701
- Will that do?
- Yes.

14:29.493 --> 14:30.327
Now, then.

14:38.460 --> 14:39.461
Thank you.

14:40.296 --> 14:41.130
Um--

14:45.426 --> 14:46.343
Hey, hold on.

14:46.886 --> 14:49.597
Did she refer to Mr. Oh as Grandpa?

14:49.680 --> 14:51.390
Yes, she must be his granddaughter.

14:53.726 --> 14:56.854
Right. They look alike,
now that I think about it, right?

14:56.937 --> 14:58.772
They're both small and wear glasses.

15:00.357 --> 15:03.235
But didn't it seem like she was forced
to lend us her place?

15:03.319 --> 15:04.236
- Right?
- Yes.

15:05.988 --> 15:06.864
I feel bad.

15:07.781 --> 15:08.699
Enough of that.

15:09.199 --> 15:11.535
- Let's wash up and strategize.
- All right.

15:12.912 --> 15:15.080
- God, my stomach really hurts.
- Whoa, ouch.

15:38.771 --> 15:39.647
The reason being?

15:39.730 --> 15:42.983
I think we need to capture
Yang Jae-myeong first and gather intel.

15:43.067 --> 15:43.984
What about you?

15:46.779 --> 15:48.072
MR. MOON, PRESIDENT IM

15:48.155 --> 15:50.741
I think we need to gather allies first.

15:50.824 --> 15:52.534
Moving together will create synergy.

15:52.618 --> 15:53.702
I like that too.

15:55.788 --> 15:57.414
But how are we going to find him?

15:57.915 --> 16:00.209
Mr. Choi said he'd be our greatest asset.

16:01.085 --> 16:02.878
I thought about it on our way to Seoul.

16:02.962 --> 16:05.130
But it won't be easy
to meet the lil Group heir.

16:05.214 --> 16:07.091
I'll come up with a plan somehow.

16:07.174 --> 16:08.008
All right.

16:14.139 --> 16:15.307
- Woo-jin!
- What?

16:21.397 --> 16:23.232
You can drop the top on this model.

16:23.315 --> 16:24.733
- The roof retracts?
- Yes.

16:24.817 --> 16:26.110
It's made of fabric.

16:36.954 --> 16:37.788
Brother.

16:40.916 --> 16:42.584
A lot of loan sharks in Myeong-dong

16:42.668 --> 16:45.212
got screwed over by Smile Capital,
just like you.

16:45.295 --> 16:47.673
I suggest we gather them
and form a united front.

16:47.756 --> 16:49.550
The loan sharks in this neighborhood…

16:50.050 --> 16:52.094
You know all of them
through your connections.

16:52.177 --> 16:55.639
If you were to take the lead,
those folks would all fall in line.

16:58.350 --> 16:59.268
And after that?

16:59.351 --> 17:01.395
You can take back your money

17:01.478 --> 17:05.274
and make sure Smile Capital never pulls
this kind of stunt again.

17:06.191 --> 17:08.110
We'll obliterate them. How's that?

17:08.193 --> 17:09.945
You lost a few hundred million.

17:16.952 --> 17:18.037
I can't do it.

17:19.496 --> 17:21.707
If your plan goes south, I might die.

17:21.790 --> 17:23.375
What about the money you lost?

17:23.459 --> 17:24.918
Fuck the money.

17:26.170 --> 17:27.880
I can just make it back, okay?

17:28.380 --> 17:29.840
I'm not getting involved.

17:29.923 --> 17:32.468
I value my life over money.

17:33.052 --> 17:34.595
- Please, just this once--
- Stop.

17:50.527 --> 17:52.237
Hey, what the fuck?

17:54.073 --> 17:55.032
What happened?

17:57.409 --> 17:59.328
Sir?

18:01.371 --> 18:02.748
You aren't allowed in here.

18:04.166 --> 18:06.794
Well, if it isn't my junior marines!

18:07.795 --> 18:08.921
Sir, what happened?

18:09.880 --> 18:10.714
What?

18:11.423 --> 18:12.341
Well…

18:13.801 --> 18:14.927
A few days ago,

18:15.427 --> 18:18.430
a bunch of gangsters came
and took everything.

18:19.640 --> 18:20.557
Why?

18:29.358 --> 18:32.402
I have ten billion won in bonds
that expire in a month.

18:33.237 --> 18:38.575
If you get this money back for me,
I'll give you a 5% cut.

18:39.868 --> 18:43.372
This sounds too good to pass up.

18:43.455 --> 18:44.998
Then shall we seal the deal?

18:47.626 --> 18:51.630
An elegant lady like yourself
must not know how these deals work.

18:52.256 --> 18:54.341
Well, matters like this

18:55.217 --> 18:57.261
are generally based on mutual trust.

18:58.262 --> 18:59.930
That's how they go down.

19:06.687 --> 19:07.980
I'll find someone else.

19:10.190 --> 19:12.526
Wait, hold on now.

19:13.110 --> 19:16.155
In general, there may be
exceptions to the rule.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.913
I found out later.

19:24.997 --> 19:28.959
In the middle of that contract,
in fine print,

19:29.042 --> 19:31.712
it said that if I couldn't recover
the bonds in one month,

19:31.795 --> 19:34.298
I had to compensate them
for half of the entire amount.

19:34.381 --> 19:35.841
That's what was written.

19:39.136 --> 19:41.889
That contract sounds
like Smile Capital's MO.

19:42.514 --> 19:43.807
What's that?

19:43.891 --> 19:45.767
A company run by Kim Myeong-gil.

19:47.561 --> 19:49.730
The one that used to work for Mr. Choi?

19:50.355 --> 19:51.190
Yes.

19:51.273 --> 19:53.066
Where's that son of a bitch now?

19:54.693 --> 19:57.654
Sir, have you heard about Mr. Choi?

19:58.405 --> 19:59.239
Heard what?

19:59.948 --> 20:00.824
Mr. Choi…

20:04.036 --> 20:05.871
was killed by Kim Myeong-gil.

20:10.000 --> 20:12.294
What the hell are you talking about?

20:12.377 --> 20:16.131
Kim Myeong-gil killed Mr. Choi, Mr. Hwang,
and Mr. Lee. He killed them all.

20:19.009 --> 20:22.012
We've been lying low in the countryside
with Mr. Oh until recently.

20:22.095 --> 20:25.182
Fuck, this isn't funny at all.

20:29.186 --> 20:30.979
Man, fuck.

20:32.356 --> 20:34.316
Hey, this isn't funny, okay?

20:58.507 --> 20:59.967
Why would Mr. Choi die?

21:01.426 --> 21:02.261
Why?

21:03.887 --> 21:04.805
Why would Mr. Choi

21:05.889 --> 21:06.974
be dead?

21:09.142 --> 21:11.853
Answer me, you bastards!

21:11.937 --> 21:12.854
Fuck.

21:15.774 --> 21:19.027
What do you mean he's dead, you punks?

21:35.460 --> 21:36.795
Man, I'm tired.

21:36.878 --> 21:37.921
I'm so tired.

21:39.506 --> 21:41.049
Let's go in and get some rest.

21:41.133 --> 21:42.217
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

21:47.014 --> 21:48.015
What the hell?

21:51.268 --> 21:52.269
It's been a while.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.982
- These motherfuckers.
- Damn it.

22:10.162 --> 22:13.290
I'll tell you everything,
so just don't hit me, okay?

22:13.915 --> 22:15.876
Word spread in the homeless community,

22:15.959 --> 22:18.795
so we've been collecting IDs
at facilities for the disabled, sir.

22:18.879 --> 22:20.714
We weren't asking about you.

22:20.797 --> 22:22.466
How are things at Smile Capital?

22:23.300 --> 22:26.011
You should've been more specific
with your questions.

22:26.094 --> 22:27.888
Has the casino opened?

22:29.931 --> 22:30.766
Hold on a sec.

22:31.266 --> 22:32.267
Hey, look down.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.104
What is it?

22:38.982 --> 22:41.109
Gun-woo, try putting on a tough guy act.

22:42.027 --> 22:43.195
How do I do that?

22:43.278 --> 22:45.113
For starters, drop the formal language.

22:46.782 --> 22:51.495
But that man's clearly well over 40.
I'm uncomfortable talking down on him.

22:52.412 --> 22:56.124
All right. If he looks down on you,
give him a good smack.

22:57.250 --> 22:58.168
All right.

23:02.589 --> 23:05.842
For one, this might be hard to believe,
but I'm actually 31.

23:05.926 --> 23:08.970
Secondly, I don't look down on you,
so there's no need for violence.

23:09.054 --> 23:11.139
My body is a train wreck right now.

23:11.223 --> 23:14.267
A while back, some fucker severed
both my Achilles heels,

23:14.351 --> 23:16.728
so I spent four months in rehab.

23:16.812 --> 23:18.814
That fucker is our brother.
Watch your mouth.

23:20.107 --> 23:23.777
What happened back then was totally on me.
I totally had that coming.

23:25.320 --> 23:26.321
So, about the casino…

23:26.947 --> 23:27.864
Yes.

23:27.948 --> 23:30.075
I eavesdropped
on the director's phone call--

23:30.158 --> 23:32.202
Director? What's his name?

23:32.285 --> 23:33.161
Kim Jun-min, sir.

23:35.580 --> 23:36.415
He's alive?

23:36.498 --> 23:39.126
Some fucker slashed his neck,
so he almost died--

23:39.209 --> 23:40.585
Damn it.

23:41.503 --> 23:44.339
Right, you're all on the same team.

23:45.590 --> 23:48.718
Okay, I understand everything now, 100%.

23:48.802 --> 23:52.222
I'm going to watch my mouth now,
so there's no need to beat me, sirs.

23:52.305 --> 23:55.392
I really hate Kim Jun-min.
That fucker's a real shithead.

23:55.475 --> 23:57.519
Smile Capital's also a bunch
of motherfuckers.

23:57.602 --> 23:59.479
I'm only in it for the money, okay?

23:59.563 --> 24:02.107
I've wanted to let this out.
I'll tell you everything.

24:02.190 --> 24:04.568
We get it, so please get to the point.

24:04.651 --> 24:08.822
I overheard a call. They're still fighting
with Iil Group over the contract,

24:08.905 --> 24:11.491
so I heard Kim Myeong-gil is on edge.

24:11.575 --> 24:12.617
And?

24:13.201 --> 24:15.537
There's Im Jang-do.
He's not cool with Kim Jun-min.

24:15.620 --> 24:16.997
A real fuck-nugget, right?

24:17.080 --> 24:20.041
He was in charge of the cops,
but he disappeared one day.

24:20.125 --> 24:23.044
But Kim Myeong-gil was having fun
at a hostess bar recently

24:23.128 --> 24:25.839
and got into some beef
with some punk and broke his wrist.

24:26.423 --> 24:28.758
So the cops got called,
and it was a real mess,

24:28.842 --> 24:30.802
but it was as if nothing had happened.

24:30.886 --> 24:34.848
That's not how things are supposed to go
when cops are called to the scene.

24:34.931 --> 24:38.810
According to Kim Jun-min, Kim Myeong-gil
has found a guy to replace Im Jang-do.

24:39.311 --> 24:41.605
But he still hasn't told anyone yet.

24:42.230 --> 24:43.398
Why?

24:43.482 --> 24:45.233
He doesn't trust his own men.

24:45.984 --> 24:46.818
And?

24:47.569 --> 24:50.489
He plans on taking over
a golf course in Gyeonggi-do.

24:50.989 --> 24:53.408
That's the reason
we're busting our balls like this.

24:53.492 --> 24:55.744
We get paid peanuts,
but they work us like mules.

24:55.827 --> 24:57.412
- Right, guys?
- Yes.

24:58.955 --> 25:00.999
That concludes my brief
on the current issues.

25:03.835 --> 25:04.669
Hold on a sec.

25:12.594 --> 25:16.014
You know you're fucked
if we send this to Kim Jun-min, right?

25:16.097 --> 25:17.140
Keep your mouth shut.

25:17.224 --> 25:18.350
Do not worry, sir.

25:19.100 --> 25:21.811
If you need anything,
please feel free to call me.

25:21.895 --> 25:24.648
I also want to see
Smile Capital crash and burn.

25:24.731 --> 25:27.901
Then, can you get us
the Iil Group heir's phone number?

25:28.610 --> 25:30.403
That's beyond my capabilities.

25:30.904 --> 25:33.698
Those folks keep a tight lid on privacy.

25:35.825 --> 25:37.327
IIL GROUP CHAIRMAN'S ELDEST SON

25:41.122 --> 25:42.582
IIL GROUP HEIR
CONFIDENT TO DEVELOP A GLOBAL HOTEL

25:42.666 --> 25:46.545
I see. His name is Hong Min-beom.
He has the same last name as me.

25:47.128 --> 25:47.963
Woo-jin.

25:48.588 --> 25:50.632
Seoul has the best jajangmyeon around.

25:50.715 --> 25:51.716
Yes.

25:56.638 --> 25:59.307
Why are you using my computer
without permission?

25:59.391 --> 26:01.726
I'm logged into
all of my messenger apps on that.

26:01.810 --> 26:04.646
I'm sorry. We didn't open any of the apps.

26:05.939 --> 26:07.482
Go to the Internet café next door.

26:07.566 --> 26:09.359
Okay. I'm sorry.

26:09.442 --> 26:10.735
Hurry up and turn it off.

26:10.819 --> 26:11.778
I get it.

26:11.861 --> 26:13.280
Let us use it just this once.

26:14.823 --> 26:15.865
Make it quick.

26:15.949 --> 26:16.825
All right.

26:17.409 --> 26:18.451
We're sorry.

26:18.535 --> 26:19.536
This is tiring.

26:21.788 --> 26:22.706
How'd she know?

26:22.789 --> 26:26.293
She must've gotten a login notification
when we turned on the computer.

26:36.469 --> 26:37.679
- Damn.
- What is it?

26:38.179 --> 26:41.266
Hong Min-beom has 500,000 followers.

26:42.642 --> 26:43.685
Let's see now.

27:03.246 --> 27:04.748
Whoa, stop!

27:29.189 --> 27:30.065
Did I…

27:32.025 --> 27:35.528
not tell you to get the contract ready
by today so I can send the money?

27:36.780 --> 27:38.114
I was going to,

27:39.532 --> 27:40.909
but my father--

27:40.992 --> 27:43.161
You bastard. How dare you!

27:57.092 --> 27:57.926
Beom.

28:11.272 --> 28:13.942
Please don't kill me.

28:15.485 --> 28:19.906
Fix the contract as I said,
and bring it to me by this Friday.

28:19.989 --> 28:21.825
- Okay.
- If not, I'll release the footage.

28:21.908 --> 28:26.329
I'll make it look like you committed
suicide because of the video. Got it?

28:29.874 --> 28:31.918
Yes, sir.

29:18.590 --> 29:22.343
Do you want to get rid of Kim Myeong-gil?
We can help you.

29:23.011 --> 29:25.263
Fuck, who the hell are these bastards?

29:28.558 --> 29:31.728
WE KNOW WHERE THE HARD DRIVE
CONTAINING YOUR FOOTAGE IS LOCATED

29:32.979 --> 29:33.855
Let's meet them.

29:34.355 --> 29:38.359
If we're going to, let's do it quickly.
I have to have the contract by Friday.

29:39.194 --> 29:41.112
Then ask if they can meet up now.

29:41.196 --> 29:42.572
What if they say yes?

29:42.655 --> 29:44.157
Meet them at the bar you go to.

29:44.240 --> 29:46.326
They'll show their true colors
once they drink.

29:47.327 --> 29:48.286
Damn it.

29:51.080 --> 29:53.374
Don't worry.
I'll get two of my men to come.

30:07.388 --> 30:08.348
Hey, In-seong.

30:08.431 --> 30:09.599
- Yes.
- Tastes good, right?

30:09.682 --> 30:10.600
Yes, sir.

30:11.100 --> 30:12.393
I'm telling you not to drink.

30:13.520 --> 30:14.562
Yes, sir.

30:17.315 --> 30:18.441
Woo-jin.

30:21.402 --> 30:22.904
Hello, sir.

30:23.404 --> 30:24.405
Hello, sir.

30:28.409 --> 30:30.662
I'm Min-beom's cousin.

30:31.162 --> 30:32.664
I see. I'm Kim Gun-woo.

30:33.581 --> 30:34.541
I'm Hong Woo-jin.

30:35.041 --> 30:36.042
I DM'ed you.

30:37.836 --> 30:39.754
- Let's sit.
- Yes, sir.

30:45.635 --> 30:48.304
Why don't we chat over some drinks?

30:48.388 --> 30:49.389
Well…

30:51.474 --> 30:52.308
Well…

30:54.435 --> 30:56.145
I'm really sorry,

30:56.980 --> 30:59.357
but I got stabbed
by Kim Myeong-gil's goons

30:59.440 --> 31:02.694
and tore my liver, so I can't drink.

31:04.904 --> 31:09.492
If you don't want to drink,
just say so. It's fine.

31:15.331 --> 31:16.541
It's true, sir.

31:16.624 --> 31:18.209
Here, here,

31:19.127 --> 31:19.961
and here.

31:22.088 --> 31:23.506
We get it.

31:24.299 --> 31:26.009
It's disturbing to see. Pull it down.

31:26.092 --> 31:27.886
Yes, just sit out, then.

31:28.678 --> 31:29.596
You got stabbed too?

31:29.679 --> 31:32.390
Well, no. I just don't drink.

31:35.184 --> 31:37.478
We're going to have a deep conversation.
Let's drink.

31:41.357 --> 31:45.904
Didn't you gather us here
to put all our cards on the table?

31:45.987 --> 31:49.157
If you back out of something so trivial,
how can we trust you?

31:49.657 --> 31:51.659
And if I may be blunt,

31:52.660 --> 31:55.204
you asked to meet because you need us too.

32:03.963 --> 32:05.673
In that case, I'll take a glass.

32:06.215 --> 32:08.718
No, I will drink.

32:12.680 --> 32:13.514
All right.

32:16.476 --> 32:17.352
Now, Director Hong.

32:18.102 --> 32:19.187
Sure.

32:25.443 --> 32:26.361
Now, let's drink.

32:29.238 --> 32:30.073
Bottoms up.

32:31.407 --> 32:32.241
Okay.

32:40.708 --> 32:42.961
Damn, you're a natural.

32:43.670 --> 32:46.798
Since we're busy,
why don't we drink from these glasses?

32:46.881 --> 32:48.508
That's the way to drink whiskey.

32:48.591 --> 32:49.968
- Okay.
- Here.

32:50.468 --> 32:52.595
- Here.
- Here.

33:42.478 --> 33:43.312
Damn.

33:43.396 --> 33:45.106
- Hey, slow down a bit.
- Okay.

33:54.615 --> 33:56.659
Now we're talking.

34:02.081 --> 34:02.915
Damn it.

34:33.738 --> 34:34.655
This is fun.

34:35.239 --> 34:37.075
Gang-yong, nice to meet you.

34:38.034 --> 34:40.703
I've been stressed
because of that bastard Kim Myeong-gil.

34:40.787 --> 34:43.081
- Call me brother, man.
- Brother.

34:43.164 --> 34:45.333
- Yes! That's me. All right, pour.
- Yes, sir!

34:46.125 --> 34:48.544
Because of that son of a bitch,

34:50.004 --> 34:52.590
I now have spot baldness

34:53.174 --> 34:55.009
and hemorrhoids, damn it.

34:55.676 --> 34:58.262
He beat me when we met earlier today.

34:59.430 --> 35:00.348
Son of a bitch.

35:00.431 --> 35:04.185
The police commissioner fucking adores me!

35:04.268 --> 35:06.813
When it's just us two, he says,
"Hey, Commissioner Min…"

35:06.896 --> 35:08.815
Then I say, "Hey, brother! Don't do that."

35:08.898 --> 35:11.984
"This Commissioner Min thing,
people might get the wrong idea."

35:13.319 --> 35:16.405
Gang-yong, take care of this kid.
We're family now.

35:16.489 --> 35:18.658
Take good care of him.
He seems like a good kid.

35:18.741 --> 35:22.370
You and Woo-jin, the two of you,
do whatever you want.

35:22.453 --> 35:25.164
Fuck it. I got your back, all the way.

35:25.248 --> 35:26.541
Shall I pour you a shot?

35:26.624 --> 35:28.292
- I can't drink anymore.
- Yes, sir.

35:28.376 --> 35:29.919
I can't because of my hemorrhoids.

35:30.002 --> 35:32.421
Fuck, it's because
I worked overtime yesterday.

35:32.505 --> 35:35.007
I can usually drink
for at least another two hours.

35:54.443 --> 35:55.736
Damn it.

36:06.622 --> 36:07.790
Gang-yong.

36:15.089 --> 36:16.299
What the hell?

36:18.467 --> 36:19.969
Min-beom, did you sleep well?

36:21.971 --> 36:23.097
Did you sleep well?

36:24.807 --> 36:26.392
What's going on?

36:28.227 --> 36:32.273
You brought us to your place last night
to continue drinking.

36:32.356 --> 36:33.274
I see.

36:33.816 --> 36:35.776
I made ramyeon,
so we meant to wake you up.

36:35.860 --> 36:36.944
- We should eat.
- Okay.

36:37.028 --> 36:37.987
Take a seat.

36:38.988 --> 36:40.865
- Gun-woo, take this.
- All right.

36:40.948 --> 36:42.450
- I'll wake Gang-yong up.
- All right.

36:42.950 --> 36:45.119
Damn, how much did I drink?

36:49.165 --> 36:50.708
Gun-ho? Gun-woo?

36:52.084 --> 36:52.960
It's Gun-woo.

36:53.044 --> 36:53.961
Right.

36:56.172 --> 36:57.423
What was the plan again?

36:57.506 --> 37:01.219
Gang-yong is going to bring
a computer expert from the police agency.

37:01.302 --> 37:05.765
That person will hack Kim's phone,
then burn the hard drives in the safe.

37:05.848 --> 37:08.935
The ramyeon's all done.
You should eat and sober up.

37:09.018 --> 37:09.977
Get up.

37:11.020 --> 37:15.316
We'll do it Friday when Kim Myeong-gil
comes to Iil Group to sign the contract.

37:15.399 --> 37:16.275
Who decided that?

37:18.402 --> 37:19.278
You did.

37:20.905 --> 37:23.574
Right. Of course it's me. Jeez, let's eat.

37:23.658 --> 37:25.243
How much did we drink?

37:26.827 --> 37:27.662
Careful now.

37:32.541 --> 37:33.501
Enjoy, everyone.

37:38.631 --> 37:39.632
Eat.

37:40.466 --> 37:42.593
- Thank you for the meal.
- Thanks for the meal.

37:49.600 --> 37:51.310
It's been so long since I had this.

37:52.270 --> 37:53.396
You guys nailed it.

38:03.447 --> 38:05.116
It's huge.

38:05.199 --> 38:06.784
The ceiling is fucking high.

38:06.867 --> 38:08.703
Whoa, how many stories is this?

38:10.496 --> 38:11.539
Thank you.

38:12.248 --> 38:13.791
- Hello, everyone.
- You're here.

38:13.874 --> 38:15.501
- Hello.
- Hello.

38:17.795 --> 38:20.131
- Hello.
- Let me introduce my colleagues.

38:23.384 --> 38:24.427
You do it.

38:25.970 --> 38:28.222
I'm Sergeant Yoon Han-gu.
Nice to meet you.

38:30.141 --> 38:30.975
Hello.

38:31.809 --> 38:34.645
I'm Team Leader Kang Tae-yeong
from the Cybercrime Dept.

38:34.729 --> 38:37.064
Let's keep my presence here a secret.
Nice to meet you.

38:37.148 --> 38:38.274
- Okay.
- Nice to meet you.

38:39.150 --> 38:42.486
Let's also keep my presence a secret.
We're all here in secret.

38:42.570 --> 38:43.529
I see.

38:43.612 --> 38:47.325
Anyway, Tae-yeong is the leading authority
in cybersecurity in the country.

38:47.408 --> 38:50.661
She's going to brief you
on how to hack Kim's phone

38:50.745 --> 38:51.871
and activate the safe.

38:51.954 --> 38:53.748
Right. There are two ways.

38:53.831 --> 38:55.416
The first one is Wi-Fi.

38:55.499 --> 38:58.794
I'll install a small jammer
in the meeting room to cut off the signal,

38:58.878 --> 39:00.671
temporarily blocking Internet access.

39:00.755 --> 39:03.758
That will naturally lead Kim
to connect to Wi-Fi.

39:03.841 --> 39:07.762
I'll be able to infiltrate the phone
once he connects to the transmitter.

39:07.845 --> 39:10.056
Once I hack into his phone,
it's game over.

39:10.139 --> 39:14.060
I've also done preliminary research
on safe apps that the suspect may use.

39:14.143 --> 39:15.686
As for the second method,

39:15.770 --> 39:18.356
we get the suspect to open
a more direct path for us.

39:18.439 --> 39:21.901
You know how we scan personal QR codes
when entering buildings due to COVID?

39:21.984 --> 39:25.321
We'll post the QR code that I made
at the entrance and make him scan it.

39:25.404 --> 39:26.989
Once it's scanned into his phone,

39:27.073 --> 39:29.367
that will grant me access
to hack his phone.

39:29.450 --> 39:31.702
We'll use both methods simultaneously.

39:32.286 --> 39:33.162
Hold on.

39:35.998 --> 39:37.249
What do I have to do?

39:38.542 --> 39:41.420
You need to ensure
that our suspect stays connected to Wi-Fi

39:41.504 --> 39:42.838
for as long as possible.

39:42.922 --> 39:46.050
I'll be accessing his cloud storage
to capture all the data,

39:46.133 --> 39:48.552
but depending on the size,
it could take some time.

39:48.636 --> 39:49.720
If we're lucky,

39:49.804 --> 39:52.848
we'll be able to find evidence
of all of his crimes

39:52.932 --> 39:54.308
and his accomplices to boot.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.645
But what if…

39:59.647 --> 40:00.898
that bastard catches on?

40:02.024 --> 40:03.401
Do you have another plan?

40:05.694 --> 40:09.156
We're proceeding with both options at once
to prevent that from happening.

40:09.740 --> 40:12.993
No, that's not it! That's not…

40:15.496 --> 40:20.251
It's only right that we get rid of
that hard drive tomorrow, no matter what.

40:21.210 --> 40:23.587
I'd take his phone from him
if it were up to me.

40:23.671 --> 40:25.589
It's simple. That shouldn't be so hard.

40:25.673 --> 40:27.633
You're making it so complicated.

40:28.968 --> 40:30.344
I'll take his phone.

40:31.053 --> 40:31.887
Han-gu.

40:35.891 --> 40:39.186
May I ask what's on the hard drive?

40:39.270 --> 40:40.521
Damn it, seriously!

40:40.604 --> 40:42.064
All right, you guys…

40:43.983 --> 40:44.817
stay quiet.

40:45.651 --> 40:46.777
Yes, sir.

40:50.865 --> 40:52.908
Min-beom, a moment with me.

41:15.389 --> 41:16.265
Min-beom.

41:17.850 --> 41:19.226
You must be really anxious.

41:20.144 --> 41:22.354
This is a pretty difficult operation.

41:23.147 --> 41:25.357
Since it's unofficial,
there are limitations.

41:25.441 --> 41:26.442
Gang-yong.

41:28.527 --> 41:31.822
If I don't get rid of this drive,
I'll have to deal with Kim forever.

41:31.906 --> 41:33.032
I'll be in big trouble.

41:33.115 --> 41:35.451
That's why I am going to try my best.

41:35.951 --> 41:37.661
Please put more faith in me.

41:44.210 --> 41:45.044
All right.

42:08.275 --> 42:09.777
There's no signal.

42:15.783 --> 42:17.159
You're sure about this, right?

42:17.243 --> 42:18.118
Of course.

42:57.366 --> 42:58.951
Please measure your temperature.

43:01.537 --> 43:03.080
Scan the QR code with your camera.

43:04.081 --> 43:06.166
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

43:06.250 --> 43:08.210
This is how our system works.

43:09.587 --> 43:11.505
That's unusual. But okay.

43:20.306 --> 43:21.390
It's working.

43:32.860 --> 43:35.237
- Okay.
- Yes!

43:42.411 --> 43:43.495
What? What is it?

43:43.579 --> 43:45.205
There's nothing in his album.

43:45.289 --> 43:46.457
Give me a second.

43:55.841 --> 43:58.886
The safe app you mentioned is not here.

44:02.723 --> 44:04.058
You guys heard it, right?

44:04.141 --> 44:05.100
Yes.

44:05.184 --> 44:07.603
Im Jang-do wasn't in a position to lie.

44:10.397 --> 44:11.940
Is this asshole onto us?

44:20.699 --> 44:22.076
Goodness!

44:23.118 --> 44:24.119
Director Hong!

44:26.413 --> 44:27.706
How have you been?

44:50.062 --> 44:51.397
Damn it.

44:53.982 --> 44:54.858
What is it?

44:56.318 --> 44:58.278
There's no safe app on his phone.

45:18.006 --> 45:19.299
This asshole has two phones.

45:20.759 --> 45:21.927
What do you mean?

45:22.010 --> 45:25.431
He scanned the code with a black phone,
but this one's silver.

45:28.600 --> 45:29.435
What now?

45:29.518 --> 45:31.395
We need to make him connect to Wi-Fi.

45:41.864 --> 45:43.741
Mr. Min, he's coming here.

45:48.662 --> 45:49.955
- Sir.
- No, it's fine.

45:50.038 --> 45:51.915
- Do you need anything?
- No, it's fine.

46:00.215 --> 46:01.216
How did it go?

46:01.925 --> 46:03.594
Kim Myeong-gil has two phones.

46:03.677 --> 46:05.763
We hacked one, but there's no safe app.

46:06.472 --> 46:08.724
The phone with the app is in that pouch.

46:09.308 --> 46:10.142
And?

46:11.518 --> 46:12.853
We're working on it.

46:12.936 --> 46:16.231
Gang-yong, we don't have time.
That's not going to take long.

46:19.485 --> 46:21.278
Why don't we talk in private?

46:21.361 --> 46:22.237
Damn it.

46:24.198 --> 46:25.741
Tae-yeong, Han-gu.

46:25.824 --> 46:28.035
Can you give us a moment?

46:28.619 --> 46:29.495
Sure.

46:34.708 --> 46:37.419
What did Im Jang-do use to take the video?

46:38.253 --> 46:39.171
A cell phone.

46:39.254 --> 46:42.216
Then wouldn't Im have sent the video
to Kim Myeong-gil's phone?

46:42.299 --> 46:43.801
For confirmation?

46:43.884 --> 46:45.052
Right.

46:45.135 --> 46:49.473
Before you sign the contract,
tell him to delete the footage first.

46:49.973 --> 46:52.184
Then he has no choice
but to take out his phone.

46:52.267 --> 46:53.727
And what if he didn't send it?

46:53.811 --> 46:55.646
What if Kim lies about it? Then what?

46:56.855 --> 46:59.566
Ask him to show you
his chat history with Im Jang-do.

46:59.650 --> 47:03.028
Tell him that Im Jang-do told you
that he was going to send it to his boss.

47:03.111 --> 47:04.530
Man, seriously?

47:04.613 --> 47:06.782
Criminals like Kim Myeong-gil
trust no one.

47:07.324 --> 47:10.410
In order to verify
that Im Jang-do finished the job properly,

47:10.494 --> 47:13.497
he must have asked him to send the video
after the job was done.

47:21.421 --> 47:22.881
I don't think I can do it.

47:25.843 --> 47:26.969
Trust me.

47:27.052 --> 47:28.220
No, it's not that.

47:29.263 --> 47:31.640
I don't think
I can stand up to Kim Myeong-gil.

47:35.394 --> 47:36.770
I'm scared!

47:39.022 --> 47:41.525
Fuck, just looking at him
makes my hands tremble!

47:48.282 --> 47:49.116
Min-beom.

47:53.620 --> 47:56.790
I believe you can do it.

47:58.458 --> 48:01.503
I'll kick down those doors
and barge in if I sense trouble.

48:01.587 --> 48:03.755
And if things get out of hand,

48:05.173 --> 48:07.968
I'll use all of our family's resources
to protect you.

48:10.512 --> 48:12.222
So muster up your courage this once.

48:18.687 --> 48:21.273
We will jump in there with him, Min-beom.

48:21.940 --> 48:22.941
You can do this.

48:43.795 --> 48:45.839
You sure kept us waiting.

48:46.632 --> 48:47.716
Where were you?

48:48.884 --> 48:50.761
Would the lawyers step outside?

48:51.762 --> 48:53.388
I need some privacy with Mr. Kim.

48:54.139 --> 48:55.015
Sure.

49:08.946 --> 49:10.697
Do you want to get arrested?

49:18.580 --> 49:21.416
Where is this bravado coming from?

49:21.917 --> 49:23.377
Before we sign the contract,

49:24.294 --> 49:25.796
erase the footage.

49:28.090 --> 49:29.049
It's at home.

49:30.759 --> 49:33.804
I promise to immediately erase it at home
once we sign the contract.

49:35.764 --> 49:37.099
Are you kidding me?

49:38.141 --> 49:40.143
I know your guy sent it to your phone.

49:43.981 --> 49:45.399
Erase it while I watch.

50:03.834 --> 50:04.710
Wow.

50:23.270 --> 50:25.063
- I'm erasing it now.
- No.

50:26.231 --> 50:27.983
Let me erase it myself.

50:29.067 --> 50:29.901
I don't trust you.

50:31.778 --> 50:32.654
And if I refuse?

50:33.905 --> 50:35.699
Then I'm not signing the contract.

50:37.075 --> 50:38.326
You've totally lost it.

50:40.579 --> 50:41.413
Hey.

50:43.457 --> 50:46.209
You think my family will sit still
if you lay a finger on me?

50:47.210 --> 50:49.254
I've been acting alone
out of embarrassment.

50:49.755 --> 50:52.132
I wanted to resolve
this matter discretely.

50:53.592 --> 50:54.426
Right.

50:55.135 --> 50:57.054
My aunt's the director of the tax service.

50:57.137 --> 51:00.974
One phone call from me, and the next day,
your company will be audited.

51:01.058 --> 51:02.100
How's that?

51:02.809 --> 51:04.686
Would you like to pay
tens of billions in taxes?

51:04.770 --> 51:06.855
Want to take this all the way to the end?

51:14.571 --> 51:16.114
You've become an eloquent speaker.

51:17.908 --> 51:19.201
Threatening me like this.

51:20.077 --> 51:21.244
I learned from you.

51:25.499 --> 51:26.374
I like it.

51:29.503 --> 51:30.629
Well, I don't like it.

51:49.689 --> 51:50.941
WI-FI OFF

51:51.024 --> 51:52.734
WI-FI ON

51:56.905 --> 51:57.906
We've got a signal.

51:58.490 --> 51:59.574
Give me a second.

52:06.540 --> 52:08.291
We have the safe app.

52:08.375 --> 52:11.336
- Okay!
- Hey, quiet.

52:12.003 --> 52:13.171
I'll open the safe now.

52:19.928 --> 52:21.805
Will that be all, Director Hong?

52:23.557 --> 52:24.808
Let's sign the contract.

52:35.652 --> 52:38.405
Okay. Shall I proceed
with the incineration?

52:50.000 --> 52:51.084
Okay.

52:51.168 --> 52:52.169
Okay.

52:57.007 --> 52:58.341
TOTAL INCINERATION IN PROCESS

53:11.396 --> 53:12.230
It's done.

53:13.607 --> 53:16.401
- Hey, it really worked, right?
- Yes, for sure.

53:17.068 --> 53:19.696
- Oh, thank you.
- I'll extract the data first.

53:19.779 --> 53:21.489
Extract it all.

53:24.117 --> 53:25.327
Thanks to you all.

53:25.410 --> 53:27.037
- Not at all.
- Not at all.

53:27.120 --> 53:28.622
I'll gather all the evidence

53:28.705 --> 53:31.666
and put that bastard behind bars,
so don't worry.

53:31.750 --> 53:32.876
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

53:42.385 --> 53:45.138
Nice work. Gang-yong will call you.

53:45.222 --> 53:46.389
Okay, thank you.

53:46.473 --> 53:47.474
Thank you.

53:47.557 --> 53:49.684
This has been bugging me for a while, but…

53:50.602 --> 53:52.270
For your cut, your scar.

53:53.230 --> 53:54.981
I'd like to help you get treatment.

53:56.608 --> 54:00.445
Well, I really appreciate it,
but I'm okay.

54:01.112 --> 54:01.988
Are you sure?

54:02.072 --> 54:02.906
Yes.

54:04.074 --> 54:07.994
Thanks to this scar, I was able to meet
a lot of amazing people.

54:08.078 --> 54:11.498
It gave me the strength
to carry on instead of giving up.

54:12.415 --> 54:13.250
So,

54:14.751 --> 54:16.169
I'm okay with this scar.

54:17.003 --> 54:17.921
I understand.

54:19.214 --> 54:20.048
See you soon.

54:20.131 --> 54:21.758
- Okay.
- Okay.

54:22.759 --> 54:23.718
Take care of them.

54:23.802 --> 54:24.928
- Yes.
- I won't go far.

54:25.011 --> 54:26.179
Okay, thank you.

54:26.263 --> 54:27.222
Have a nice day.

54:30.725 --> 54:33.019
- I'm relieved it ended well.
- I know, right?

54:35.855 --> 54:37.816
- I knew things would go well.
- Yes.

54:40.360 --> 54:41.695
- Right, Gun-woo.
- Yes?

54:42.195 --> 54:46.992
Do you remember when Mr. Choi asked
Im Jang-do about the gold bars?

54:47.492 --> 54:50.954
Yes, about how only In-beom knows
where they are?

54:51.037 --> 54:51.871
Yes.

54:51.955 --> 54:53.456
How much do you think that is?

54:54.916 --> 54:55.834
I don't know.

54:56.876 --> 54:59.212
My guess is tens of billions.

55:00.964 --> 55:01.840
Well…

55:03.383 --> 55:06.136
That includes the money
he stole from Mr. Choi, right?

55:06.219 --> 55:07.053
Right.

55:07.595 --> 55:09.973
If the cops don't catch Kim Myeong-gil,

55:10.974 --> 55:14.894
he's going to take the money and gold
and hightail it overseas.

55:16.062 --> 55:18.815
We can't let that happen.
That money belongs to Mr. Choi.

55:19.607 --> 55:20.483
Let's get ready.

55:21.151 --> 55:23.361
Let's chase him down
and maul him to death.

55:24.154 --> 55:24.988
Sounds good.

55:32.329 --> 55:35.081
- Let's drink until we die tonight!
- Nice!

55:35.165 --> 55:38.293
- Beom, Jun-min, good work!
- Sir!

55:38.376 --> 55:41.338
All right, let's go
for round two at my place!

55:43.882 --> 55:44.758
What is it?

55:45.467 --> 55:46.885
Don't you smell something?

55:47.886 --> 55:49.012
Eun-seo, what's wrong?

55:49.596 --> 55:52.182
Well, I guess it does smell like smoke.

55:53.892 --> 55:55.477
Hey, quiet down.

55:59.439 --> 56:00.273
Don't.

56:18.249 --> 56:20.335
Fuck!

56:27.926 --> 56:29.344
Go back.

56:37.769 --> 56:39.938
CHOI TAE-HO

56:58.415 --> 57:00.667
- Where are you?
- Working overtime, sir.

57:01.251 --> 57:03.878
I'll send a driver with a phone right now.

57:04.462 --> 57:05.964
Find someone for me.

57:06.047 --> 57:07.382
How many people?

57:07.465 --> 57:09.050
For starters, an old man.

57:09.634 --> 57:10.844
Is this urgent?

57:10.927 --> 57:12.679
If you find him by noon tomorrow,

57:13.555 --> 57:15.098
I'll pay you triple.

57:16.683 --> 57:17.725
Yes, sir.

59:05.375 --> 59:08.336
